From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:36:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: bound the in-band discovery frame by its buffer

Upstream: https://github.com/openwrt/mt76/commit/4998112aaf329f06bd8d90472a7452e4d454729a
Fixes: 79e788fcb204 ("wifi: mt76: mt7996: change max beacon size")
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261125173616.3776951-10-nbd@nbd.name
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

diff --git a/mt7996/mcu.c b/mt7996/mcu.c
index 5de535f..b2d1460 100644
--- a/mt7996/mcu.c
+++ b/mt7996/mcu.c
@@ -3755,7 +3755,7 @@ int mt7996_mcu_beacon_inband_discov(struct mt7996_dev *dev,
 		return -EINVAL;
 	}
 
-	if (skb->len > MT7996_MAX_BEACON_SIZE) {
+	if (skb->len > MT7996_MAX_INBAND_FRAME_SIZE) {
 		dev_err(dev->mt76.dev, "inband discovery size limit exceed\n");
 		dev_kfree_skb(rskb);
 		dev_kfree_skb(skb);
diff --git a/mt7996/mcu.h b/mt7996/mcu.h
index 172c937..16caaef 100644
--- a/mt7996/mcu.h
+++ b/mt7996/mcu.h
@@ -1021,6 +1021,7 @@ enum {
 #define MT7996_MAX_BSS_OFFLOAD_SIZE	2048
 #define MT7996_MAX_BEACON_SIZE		(MT7996_MAX_BSS_OFFLOAD_SIZE - \
 					 MT7996_BEACON_UPDATE_SIZE)
+#define MT7996_MAX_INBAND_FRAME_SIZE	1520
 
 enum {
 	UNI_BAND_CONFIG_RADIO_ENABLE,
